# ===== TROUBLESHOOTING =====
th("If something goes wrong, do not throw it out. Most problems are fixable.","bench")
split("Sticky, soft resin means the ratio was off. A fresh thin coat on top usually seals it.","a sticky resin surface getting a fresh clear coat brushed over it","bench","left")
full("a cloudy resin block beside a clear one for comparison","Cloudy resin usually means it was poured too cold. Warm the bottles in water first next time.","close-up")
